    "lore": [
      "A Traveller's Guide to Aldmoor: 'Mind the goblin raiders west of the farms, and never cross the northern stones into the Bloodmarch unprepared.'",
      "Herblore for Beginners: 'Salmon and venison stew will restore far more vitality than a crust of bread.'",
      "On Sigils: 'A staff of the right element will supply that element's sigil without end.'",
      "The Saga of Skarn: 'The raiders of the south fear nothing but the cold and the crypt.'",
      "Recipes of the Gilded Tankard, page 3: 'Royal feast pie. Serves one very hungry knight.'",
      "A worn diary: 'Heard scratching beneath the graveyard again. The priests say it is only rats.'"
    ],
    "texts": {
      "castle_archives": "The Chronicle of Aldmoor: '...and the Fallen King was sealed beneath the graveyard east of the Aln, his crown of bone still upon his brow.'",
      "magic_tomes": "Gale, Tide, Stone and Ember: the four sigils of the elements. Focus binds them, Storm unleashes them, Void ends them.",
      "town_sign": "North: Darkwood Forest & the Bloodmarch. West: Hob's Farm & the Goblin Camp. East: River Aln & the Graveyard. South: Skarn Hold.",
      "farm_sign": "Farmer Hob's fields. Please don't anger the cows.",
      "graveyard_sign": "Here lie the honoured dead of Aldmoor. Disturb not the Fallen King.",
      "bloodmarch_sign": "BEWARE! Beyond lies the Bloodmarch, a lawless land. Other adventurers may attack you there.",
      "quarry_sign": "Aldmoor Quarry. Copper and tin for beginners; iron, coal, silver and gold for the seasoned. Mind the essence rocks: they hum.",
      "allotments_sign": "Aldmoor Allotments. Plant seeds, water each stage, harvest when ripe. Crops keep growing while you're away. Seeds from Farmer Hob."
    },
